    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "nginx", "x": 100, "y": 200, "width": 1030, "height": 90, "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "#3b82f6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200020, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200021, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "nginx_t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "nginx_t", "x": 120, "y": 215, "width": 990, "height": 60, "text": "nginx.service  :80 → :443  (HTTPS reverse proxy + 정적 파일 서빙)\n/auth/ → 127.0.0.1:8080   ·   /api/ → 127.0.0.1:8000   ·   / → /opt/iot-platform/frontend/current/", "originalText": "nginx.service  :80 → :443  (HTTPS reverse proxy + 정적 파일 서빙)\n/auth/ → 127.0.0.1:8080   ·   /api/ → 127.0.0.1:8000   ·   / → /opt/iot-platform/frontend/current/", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200022, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200023, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "nginx", "lineHeight": 1.4},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "keycloak", "x": 100, "y": 320, "width": 500, "height": 180, "strokeColor": "#6d28d9", "backgroundColor": "#ddd6fe", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200030, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200031, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "keycloak_t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "keycloak_t", "x": 115, "y": 335, "width": 470, "height": 150, "text": "keycloak.service  :8080\n\nRealm: iot-platform\n7 roles · groups (회사 매핑)\nDB backend: PostgreSQL (db=keycloak)\nOIDC issuer + JWT 서명/검증", "originalText": "keycloak.service  :8080\n\nRealm: iot-platform\n7 roles · groups (회사 매핑)\nDB backend: PostgreSQL (db=keycloak)\nOIDC issuer + JWT 서명/검증", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200032, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200033, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "keycloak", "lineHeight": 1.35},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "backend", "x": 630, "y": 320, "width": 500, "height": 180, "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "#60a5fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200040, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200041, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "backend_t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "backend_t", "x": 645, "y": 335, "width": 470, "height": 150, "text": "iot-backend.service · FastAPI :8000\n\nGateway · Sensor Profile API\nPermission check (User × Gateway)\nCommand publish · Config 발행\nuvicorn workers=4", "originalText": "iot-backend.service · FastAPI :8000\n\nGateway · Sensor Profile API\nPermission check (User × Gateway)\nCommand publish · Config 발행\nuvicorn workers=4", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200042, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200043, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "backend", "lineHeight": 1.35},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "worker", "x": 100, "y": 530, "width": 500, "height": 180, "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "#60a5fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200050, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200051, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "worker_t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "worker_t", "x": 115, "y": 545, "width": 470, "height": 150, "text": "iot-worker.service · Python asyncio\n\nMQTT subscribe gw/+/+\ntelemetry → INSERT + UPSERT latest\nalarm rule eval · command response 처리\nreported_config 처리", "originalText": "iot-worker.service · Python asyncio\n\nMQTT subscribe gw/+/+\ntelemetry → INSERT + UPSERT latest\nalarm rule eval · command response 처리\nreported_config 처리", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200052, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200053, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "worker", "lineHeight": 1.35},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "scheduler", "x": 630, "y": 530, "width": 500, "height": 180, "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "#60a5fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200060, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200061, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "scheduler_t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "scheduler_t", "x": 645, "y": 545, "width": 470, "height": 150, "text": "iot-scheduler.service · Python\n\nGateway offline 판단 (heartbeat)\ncommand timeout 처리\npartition 정리 (월별 drop)\npg_dump 백업 · OTA job 상태", "originalText": "iot-scheduler.service · Python\n\nGateway offline 판단 (heartbeat)\ncommand timeout 처리\npartition 정리 (월별 drop)\npg_dump 백업 · OTA job 상태", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200062, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200063, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "scheduler", "lineHeight": 1.35},

