    {"type": "text", "id": "vernemq_t", "x": 645, "y": 755, "width": 470, "height": 190, "text": "vernemq.service\n:1883 (plain · Phase 1-6)\n:8883 (TLS · Phase 7)\n\nGateway별 ACL\nPhase 1: password file\nPhase 7: X.509 client cert + serial → topic\nLWT (gw/{id}/state offline)\nQoS 1 · clean_session=false", "originalText": "vernemq.service\n:1883 (plain · Phase 1-6)\n:8883 (TLS · Phase 7)\n\nGateway별 ACL\nPhase 1: password file\nPhase 7: X.509 client cert + serial → topic\nLWT (gw/{id}/state offline)\nQoS 1 · clean_session=false", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200082, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200083, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "vernemq", "lineHeight": 1.35},

