    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "hal_box", "x": 1270, "y": 830, "width": 1030, "height": 250, "strokeColor": "#b45309", "backgroundColor": "#fef3c7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200290, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200291, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "hal_t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "hal_t", "x": 1285, "y": 845, "width": 1000, "height": 220, "text": "libgw_hal.so  (C11, hal/include/gw_hal.h ABI v0.1.0)\n\nplatform_pi4.c   (BCM2711 — Pi 4 + CM4 공통, libgpiod v1.x)\nplatform_r1124.c (Phase 1+ stub)\nrs485.c          (termios + Modbus RTU CRC-16 0xA001)\nwatchdog.c       (/dev/watchdog ioctl WDIOC_KEEPALIVE)\ncommon.c         (lifecycle + version + 4G modem stubs)\n\nABI: gw_gpio_init/request/set/get/assert_safe_state\n     gw_rs485_open/modbus_read/modbus_write/close\n     gw_watchdog_open/kick/close", "originalText": "libgw_hal.so  (C11, hal/include/gw_hal.h ABI v0.1.0)\n\nplatform_pi4.c   (BCM2711 — Pi 4 + CM4 공통, libgpiod v1.x)\nplatform_r1124.c (Phase 1+ stub)\nrs485.c          (termios + Modbus RTU CRC-16 0xA001)\nwatchdog.c       (/dev/watchdog ioctl WDIOC_KEEPALIVE)\ncommon.c         (lifecycle + version + 4G modem stubs)\n\nABI: gw_gpio_init/request/set/get/assert_safe_state\n     gw_rs485_open/modbus_read/modbus_write/close\n     gw_watchdog_open/kick/close", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200292, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200293, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "hal_box", "lineHeight": 1.5},

    {"type": "rectangle", "id": "wdt_box", "x": 1270, "y": 1110, "width": 1030, "height": 220, "strokeColor": "#dc2626", "backgroundColor": "#fee2e2", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200300, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200301, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [{"id": "wdt_t", "type": "text"}], "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}},
    {"type": "text", "id": "wdt_t", "x": 1285, "y": 1125, "width": 1000, "height": 190, "text": "Watchdog 3-Layer (각 상위 < 하위 timeout)\n\nApplication (Go panic recover)   ← 즉시   defer hal.AssertSafeState + os.Exit(1)\nsystemd WatchdogSec=30           ← 30s   sd_notify WATCHDOG=1 매 10s, 미수신 시 SIGABRT\nKernel WDT (BCM2835)             ← 15s   /dev/watchdog kick 매 5s, 미수신 시 hardware reboot\n\n+ NC Wiring (electrical fail-safe) — 전원 차단 자동 안전 상태", "originalText": "Watchdog 3-Layer (각 상위 < 하위 timeout)\n\nApplication (Go panic recover)   ← 즉시   defer hal.AssertSafeState + os.Exit(1)\nsystemd WatchdogSec=30           ← 30s   sd_notify WATCHDOG=1 매 10s, 미수신 시 SIGABRT\nKernel WDT (BCM2835)             ← 15s   /dev/watchdog kick 매 5s, 미수신 시 hardware reboot\n\n+ NC Wiring (electrical fail-safe) — 전원 차단 자동 안전 상태", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200302, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200303, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "wdt_box", "lineHeight": 1.5},

