    {"type": "text", "id": "boot_t", "x": 1285, "y": 1370, "width": 1000, "height": 75, "text": "부팅 흐름 14단계 (main.go)\n01 config 02 HAL.Init 03 WDT 04 SQLite 05 MQTT.New 06 sd_notify READY (local-ready)\n07 sensor.Init 08 actuator.Init 09 polling 10 subscribe 11 health 12 CONNACK (cloud-ready) 13 SIGTERM 14 cleanup", "originalText": "부팅 흐름 14단계 (main.go)\n01 config 02 HAL.Init 03 WDT 04 SQLite 05 MQTT.New 06 sd_notify READY (local-ready)\n07 sensor.Init 08 actuator.Init 09 polling 10 subscribe 11 health 12 CONNACK (cloud-ready) 13 SIGTERM 14 cleanup", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 200312, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200313, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "boot_box", "lineHeight": 1.4}
